type: software
title: "The critical signal fraction for local entropy concavity"
abstract: "Unrefereed research candidate. Near the Gaussian, Gaussian noise restores mixing-weight entropy concavity for symmetric inputs exactly below signal fraction 4/7 (signal-to-noise ratio 4/3); the boundary q = 4/7 itself is open."
